{"version":1,"content":"<p>Anthropic於11月9日正式推出新一代旗艦人工智能模型Claude Fable 5.2和Claude Mythos 5.2。新版本重點提升了編程、邏輯推理和視覺理解能力，同時改善了模型的表達質量。根據Anthropic公佈的數據，兩款模型的輸出速度最高比上一代快30%，而API調用價格則降低了20%。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585668.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.341608+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T19:54:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"7d571009b79fdf8bac9e889c91756cb05f3cc8468051482a0c0b912d112600f8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}